The data shown comes from Hyperliquid's public info API, websocket and leaderboard. Hyperliquid is a trademark
of its owner; this project is not affiliated with, endorsed by or connected to Hyperliquid. Wallet addresses
and display names are shown as Hyperliquid serves them. Coin logos are loaded from Hyperliquid's app when a list
shows them; they are not part of this repository and belong to their projects.

demo/sample/recorded.json.gz holds a condensed board, info answers and forty seconds of trades of $10K and up,
recorded from those public sources on October 27, 2026 (UTC) and trimmed to the fields the library reads. The
recording tour replays them so the preview is the same on every loop: the trades are shown as just made, though
they were made when the recording was. They are real data from that date, not made up, and they are not current.

